<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>aphrodite - sped up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Ashley Sienna</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">aphrodite (sped up)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">32bG6K4lq8MO45abSFqXC6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.860" end="00:11.200">So soft, so soft</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.200" end="00:13.370">The soft skin on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.370" end="00:15.680">Like god, like god</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.680" end="00:17.720">My body moves with grace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.720" end="00:19.880">I see my soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.880" end="00:22.700">When I look in the mirror</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.700" end="00:24.250">Two black holes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.250" end="00:27.140">That keep pulling me deeper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.140" end="00:29.250">See her, need her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.250" end="00:31.280">God I love her features</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.280" end="00:33.680">Her sweetness, your weakness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.680" end="00:36.050">Make heaven on venus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.050" end="00:38.180">That's me, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.180" end="00:40.480">God I am so happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.480" end="00:42.590">That you made me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.590" end="00:45.130">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.130" end="00:47.530">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.530" end="00:49.680">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.680" end="00:51.770">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.770" end="00:53.820">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.820" end="00:56.480">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.480" end="00:58.520">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.520" end="01:00.660">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.660" end="01:02.400">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.400" end="01:04.070">On a bed of seashells</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.070" end="01:05.570">Nothing but pearls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.040" end="01:06.540">Drape her details</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.160" end="01:07.660">Ocean air curls</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.160" end="01:08.660">Breathe in, exhale</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.420" end="01:11.900">You're in her world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.900" end="01:13.930">See her, need her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.930" end="01:15.730">God I love her features</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.730" end="01:18.370">Her sweetness, your weakness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.370" end="01:20.420">Make heaven on venus</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.420" end="01:22.840">That's me, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.840" end="01:25.150">God I am so happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.150" end="01:27.240">That you made me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.240" end="01:29.700">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.700" end="01:31.990">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.990" end="01:34.090">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.090" end="01:36.460">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.460" end="01:38.560">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.560" end="01:40.830">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.830" end="01:42.940">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.940" end="01:45.140">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.140" end="01:47.430">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.430" end="01:50.080">Adore her love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.080" end="01:56.380">Her sacred touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.380" end="01:58.900">Floats like a dove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.900" end="02:05.540">From up above</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.540" end="02:07.810">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.810" end="02:09.970">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.970" end="02:12.060">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.060" end="02:14.480">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.480" end="02:16.770">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.770" end="02:18.830">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.830" end="02:20.910">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.910" end="02:23.240">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.240" end="02:25.300">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.300" end="02:27.430">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.430" end="02:29.540">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.540" end="02:31.840">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.840" end="02:34.250">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.250" end="02:36.310">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.310" end="02:38.660">Ahhh, ahhh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.660" end="02:43.690">Blessed by aphrodite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.690" end="02:47.690" /></div></body></tt>